==Battleground==
*12 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[E. Honda (Enemy)|E. Honda]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
**3 [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**6 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
E. Honda's pierce makes him a tricky enemy to handle, despite the fact that he doesn't have a lot of personal damage. You'll want to chunk him and his support with [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], and whatever other ranged attackers you own. He doesn't pose much of a threat on his own, so take advantage of downtime to beat him up as much as possible.

